        "@value": "Set at the Fortress of Louisbourg in early 1700s New France, Swan Lake reimagines the classic tale in a striking Canadian setting. Odette, a young maiden transformed into a swan by the sorcerer Von Rothbart, lives under his dark enchantment in the su [...]"
