      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For over three decades, HOTEL CALIFORNIA has been recreating the legendary sound of the EAGLES and thrilling audiences all over the world.\nThe band set the bar in 1986, and they’ve remained the industry-leading substitute for the Eagles ever since [...]"
