        "@value": "Multi-award winning vocalist, pianist, songwriter and national radio host Laila Biali is thrilled to share her latest tribute project, Joni Mitchell & the Canadian Songbook Reimagined - a memorable concert experience filled with dynamic covers of our [...]"
