        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n        \nThe Johner Brothers\n\n  \nThu, Feb 11, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\nLuseland, SK – @ Luseland Homecoming Hall\nPresented by Luseland Arts Council\n\n\n\n\nIn 1991, The Johner Brothers took the Canadian country music audience by storm. Brad and Ken were named \"Duo of the Year\" by the Canadian Country Music Association, kicking off a string of awards. After being crowned 'Entertainer of the Decade' and releasing a remarkable 26 singles from six hit albums, Ken retired from the music business in 2002. Brad continued with a hugely successful solo career, recording six highly praised albums and awarded \"Male Artist of the Year\" by the CCMA. \n\nAfter twenty years, the Johner Brothers are back together and looking forward to a busy year playing shows across western Canada. Backed by two of Brad's sons, the show is a fresh version of what Johner fans have come to expect as they are astute professionals and true gentlemen of the stage.\n\n\nCountry\n\nWatch Video:\n\nAppearances\n\n\n\n\n\nWed, Jan 13, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nAssiniboia, SK - Prince of Wales Cultural & Recreation Centre\n\nPresented by Assiniboia & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nThu, Jan 14, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nLeader, SK - Leader Community Centre\n\nPresented by Leader & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, Jan 15, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nMacklin, SK - Macklin Credit Union Legacy Center\n\nPresented by Macklin Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nSat, Jan 16, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nBiggar, SK - Majestic Theatre\n\nPresented by Biggar & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nWed, Feb 3, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nTicket Info\n\n\n\nMoosomin, SK - Moosomin Community Theatre\n\nPresented by Moosomin & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nThu, Feb 4, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nKipling, SK - Kipling Community Centre\n\nPresented by Kipling & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, Feb 5, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nIndian Head, SK - Indian Head Memorial Hall\n\nPresented by Indian Head Theatre and Community Arts Inc.\n\n\n\n\n\nSat, Feb 6, 2027 @ 8:00 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nLangenburg, SK - George Layh Theatre\n\nPresented by Langenburg Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nThu, Feb 11, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nLuseland, SK - Luseland Homecoming Hall\n\nPresented by Luseland Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, Feb 12, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nKindersley, SK - Norman Ritchie Community Centre\n\nPresented by Kindersley & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nSat, Feb 13, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nShellbrook, SK - Shellbrook Theatre\n\nPresented by Shellbrook & District Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, Mar 19, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nLa Ronge, SK - Jonas Roberts Memorial Community Centre\n\nPresented by La Ronge Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nSat, Mar 20, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nTisdale, SK - John Barron Auditorium\n\nPresented by Tisdale Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nThu, Apr 8, 2027 @ 7:00 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nYorkton, SK - Anne Portnuff Theatre, Yorkton Regional High School\n\nPresented by Yorkton Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, Apr 9, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nWynyard, SK - Wynyard Civic Centre\n\nPresented by Quill Plains Regional Arts Council (QPRAC) - Main\n\n\n\n\n\nSat, Apr 10, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nWeyburn, SK - The Cugnet Centre\n\nPresented by Weyburn Concert Series\n\n\n\n\n\nWed, Apr 28, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nRegina, SK - Darke Hall\n\nPresented by Darke Hall Society Inc.\n\n\n\n\n\nThu, Apr 29, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nCanora, SK - Canora Composite School\n\nPresented by Canora Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, Apr 30, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nHudson Bay, SK - Brooks Hall\n\nPresented by Hudson Bay Allied Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nSat, May 1, 2027 @ 7:30 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nNipawin, SK - Evergreen Centre\n\nPresented by Nipawin Performing Arts Group\n\n\n\n\n\nThu, May 6, 2027 @ 7:00 pm\n\n\n\n\n\nMelfort, SK - Kerry Vickar Centre\n\nPresented by Melfort Arts Council\n\n\n\n\n\nFri, May 7, 2027 @ 7: